# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  ⚠️  SECURITY: every variable here is prefixed VITE_, which means
#  Vite INLINES it into the public client bundle. Anyone can read it
#  in the browser. ONLY put non-secret, publicly-shareable values here.
#
#  NEVER prefix a real secret (API key, DB URL, private key, token,
#  webhook secret) with VITE_. This is a static client-only site — it
#  has no server, so there is no safe place for secrets in this repo.
#  If you add a backend later, keep secrets in server-only env vars
#  (no VITE_ prefix) and read them only in server code.
#
#  Copy this file to .env (which is gitignored) and fill in if desired.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Analytics — public measurement IDs (safe to expose). Empty = nothing loads.
# Google Analytics 4 (public measurement ID, e.g. G-XXXXXXXXXX)
VITE_GA_ID=
# Google Tag Manager (public container ID, e.g. GTM-XXXXXXX)
VITE_GTM_ID=
# Meta (Facebook) Pixel (public pixel ID)
VITE_META_PIXEL_ID=
